TITLE:: RCBatch
summary:: A keyed collection of orgnsms cloned from one template
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Guides/reCurrent, Classes/RCOrgnsm, Classes/RCPathControl

DESCRIPTION::
The proto-library's batch. Iteration functions receive code::(orgnsm, index, list, key):: (they received code::(s, o, i, l, k):: before). Bulk operations are guarded: one failing orgnsm is reported, the others are processed.

